@startuml
title Customer-facing view navigation map (proposed)
hide empty description
skinparam shadowing false

state "VIEW-C-001\nTravel portal home" as C001
state "VIEW-C-009\nSearch results" as C009
state "VIEW-C-010\nTravel detail" as C010
state "VIEW-C-002\nTravel composition" as C002
state "VIEW-C-011\nSign in" as C011 #E8F4FF
state "VIEW-C-012\nRegistration" as C012 #E8F4FF
state "VIEW-C-003\nSales offer" as C003
state "VIEW-C-004\nTravel order" as C004
state "VIEW-C-005\nPayment" as C005
state "VIEW-C-006\nTravel documents" as C006
state "VIEW-C-007\nTravel assistance" as C007
state "VIEW-C-008\nCustomer account" as C008

[*] --> C001 : enter customer interaction
C001 --> C009 : search with criteria
C009 --> C009 : refine criteria / no matching availability
C009 --> C010 : select travel product
C010 --> C009 : return to results
C010 --> C002 : compose or customise travel
C002 --> C010 : revise selection
C002 --> C003 : request offer [authenticated Customer]
C002 --> C011 : request offer [not authenticated]
C011 --> C003 : sign-in succeeds [offer request pending]
C011 --> C008 : sign-in succeeds [no interrupted destination]
C011 --> C012 : register instead
C011 --> C011 : sign-in rejected / retry or recover access
C011 --> C002 : cancel [offer request pending]
C011 --> C001 : cancel [no interrupted destination]
C012 --> C003 : registration succeeds [offer request pending]
C012 --> C008 : registration succeeds [no interrupted destination]
C012 --> C011 : sign in instead
C012 --> C012 : validation fails / correct registration
C012 --> C002 : cancel [offer request pending]
C012 --> C001 : cancel [no interrupted destination]
C003 --> C002 : revise composition
C003 --> C004 : accept offer
C004 --> C005 : make payment
C005 --> C005 : payment failed or pending / retry or return
C005 --> C004 : return to order
C004 --> C006 : obtain eligible documents
C006 --> C006 : documents unavailable / review conditions
C006 --> C004 : return to order
C004 --> C007 : request assistance
C007 --> C007 : continue assistance or unresolved handover
C007 --> C004 : review related order
C001 --> C007 : request ongoing help
C001 --> C011 : sign in
C001 --> C008 : open customer account [authenticated Customer]
C008 --> C004 : review an order
C008 --> C001 : return to discovery

note bottom
  Anonymous exploration is permitted through composition and availability.
  A Sales Offer is presented only after successful authentication.
  Failures remain within their originating view; confirmed context is preserved.
end note
@enduml
